# CR 608.2b: the attack trigger has one target, Cathar Commando, and Bot1 kills it with Lightning Bolt in response. The
# trigger is then removed from the stack without resolving, so its second sentence ("If you're the monarch, creatures
# can't block this turn") never happens although Bot1 holds the crown: Ornithopter blocks Elvish Mystic.

